    <description>Configuration object defining the segments of the Opportunity auto-generated Name. Each active record represents one segment (e.g. Account Name, Quarter Year, Type, Business Unit, Billing Region). Segments are ordered by Order__c and resolved dynamically by IRM_OppNamingAction at Opportunity creation and when the Name still contains TBD placeholders.</description>
